+  RETURN VALUE
+    The result code associated with performing the operation  
+
+    VOS_STATUS_E_FAULT:  pointer to BAP cb is NULL ; access would cause a page 
+                         fault  
+    VOS_STATUS_SUCCESS:  Everything is good :) 
+
+  SIDE EFFECTS 
+  
+============================================================================*/
+VOS_STATUS 
+WLANBAP_RegisterDataPlane
