+  FUNCTION    WLAN_BAPReadFailedContactCounter()
+
+  DESCRIPTION 
+    Implements the actual HCI Read Failed Contact Counter command.  There 
+    is no need for a callback because when this call returns the action 
+    has been completed.
+
+  DEPENDENCIES 
