+ *    "built in" default values compiled into the code
+ *  values are a bitmap indicating which log levels are to enabled
+ *    (must match order of vos_trace_level enumerations)
+ *    00000001  FATAL
+ *    00000010  ERROR
+ *    00000100  WARN
