+/**
+ * -------------------------------------------------------------------------*
+ *  MAC parameter structure                                                *
+ *  This structure is the only interface passed between the MAC FW and the *
+ *  host driver.                                                           *
+ *                                                                         *
+ *  Host-to-MAC parameters:                                                *
+ *  =======================                                                *
