+*
+*
+*WNI_CFG_BACKGROUND_SCAN_LIST    S    128    8
+*V    RW    NP RESTART
+*LIM
+*60   36 0 40 0 44 0 48 0 52 0 56 0 60 0 64 0 1 0 6 0 11 0 34 0 38 0 42 0 46 0 2 0 3 0 4 0 5 0 7 0 8 0 9 0 10 0 12 0 13 0 14 0 149 0 153 0 157 0 161 0
