+*
+* 4.  HT Info Field2: 2 bytes
+*
+* Operation mode is set to 0(Pure, GF) to begin with and
+*                 will be updated dynamically.
+* 'NonGF Devices present is also set to zero and
+*                 will be updated dynamically.
