+\fn      pmmSendWowlAddBcastPtrn
+\brief   This function sends a SIR_HAL_WOWL_ADD_BCAST_PTRN
+\        message to HAL.
+\param   tpAniSirGlobal  pMac
+\param   tpSirMsgQ       pMsg
+\return  None
