+
+          VOS_STATUS_E_INVAL - packet type not RX_RAW 
+
+          VOS_STATUS_SUCCESS - transform successful
+
+          other VOSS status - other errors encountered
+    
+  \sa
+  
+  ----------------------------------------------------------------------------*/
