+    IN
+    pvBDHeader:    Void pointer to the RxBD buffer.
+    usFrmCtrl:the frame ctrl of the 802.11 header 
+   
+  RETURN VALUE
+    A byte which contains both type and subtype info. LSB four bytes (b0 to b3)
+    is subtype and b5-b6 is type info. 
